flowchart TB
  accTitle: A Daily Workflow Combining Claude Code Commands
  accDescr: Supply project conventions through CLAUDE.md, explore requirements, and plan. Write a failing test before implementation, then edit and run tests. Review and simplify the changes, verify the final result, and complete the task.
  subgraph design["Stage 1 · Requirements and planning"]
    direction LR
    conventions["Supply project conventions<br/>CLAUDE.md"]
    brainstorm["Explore requirements<br/>Clarify goals and scope"]
    plan["Create an implementation plan<br/>/plan"]
    conventions --> brainstorm --> plan
  end
  subgraph implementation["Stage 2 · Implementation and tests"]
    direction LR
    test["Write a test first<br/>Confirm the expected failure"]
    code["Implement the behavior<br/>Keep changes focused"]
    run["Run tests<br/>Fix remaining failures"]
    test --> code --> run
    run -->|"Tests fail"| code
  end
  subgraph quality["Stage 3 · Review and verification"]
    direction LR
    review["Review and fix issues<br/>/code-review --fix"]
    simplify["Remove duplication<br/>/simplify"]
    verify["Run verification again<br/>Inspect the final changes"]
    review --> simplify --> verify
  end
  done["Verification passes<br/>Report the result and finish"]
  design --> implementation
  implementation -->|"Tests pass"| quality
  quality --> done
